{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49886","headline":"菩萨蛮 · 林楚翘","name":"菩萨蛮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"画堂春昼垂珠箔，卧来揉惹金钗落。\n簟滑枕头移，鬓蝉狂欲飞。\n笑拖娇眼慢，罗袖笼花面。\n重道好郎君，人前莫恼人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林楚翘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49886.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49886","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}